 "about": [
  "Default YouTube TV watch codes (https://tv.youtube.com/watch/<code>) for the channels RedZone needs.",
  "Every code here was copied from a public post or file listed under 'sources'. Nothing is guessed: a channel with no published code has an empty 'codes' list and is found by in-app search on the stick.",
  "Codes are per channel, not per account, but they do change now and then, and East/West feeds have different codes. Raleigh-Durham is Eastern, so East codes come first.",
  "Each code is only a candidate until 'python -m redzone.discovery.yttv --verify' has played it on a stick and seen the right channel name. Results go to data/yttv_verified.json."
 ],
